    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abo bakashoka na Ezila",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū aba h'abo baalī batongeeji ba kaya ja bakūlūgenji babo, na a babo bakandīkwa hamò nabo. Hū bene abo bakīnga hamò nane ī Babuloni, mu shikū ja būsugi bo ntemi Atashasta: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Finehasi walīho Gelishomu; ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Itamaali walīho Danyeli; ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Daūdi walīho Hatushi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa mu kaya ya ng'wa Shekania. Ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Paloshi; Zakalia na banhū igana na makūmi atanò abo baalī bandīkwa hamò nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Pahati-moabu; Eliehona ng'witūnja o ng'wa Zelahiya, walī na banhū magana abīlī ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Zatu; Shekania o ng'wa Yahazieli, walī na banhū magana adatū ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Adini; Ebedi o ng'wa Yonasani, walī na banhū makūmi atanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Elamu; Yeshaya o ng'wa Asalia, walī na banhū makūmi mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Shefatia; Zebadia o ng'wa Mikaeli, walī na banhū makūmi anaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Yoabu; Obadia o ng'wa Yehieli, walī na banhū magana abīlī n'ikūmi n'inaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Bani; Shelomitī o ng'wa Yosifia, walī na banhū igana na makūmi atandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Bebai; Zakalia o ng'wa Bebai, walī na banhū makūmi abīlī na banaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Azigadi; Yonasani o ng'wa Hakatani, walī na banhū igana n'ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Adonikamu; abo bakabiza ba kūmalīja, a mina gabo ba Elifeleti, Yeūli, na Shemaya hamò na banhū makūmi atandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Bigivai; Usai na Zakuli, hamò na banhū makūmi mpungatī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Batūmami ba mu hekalu kūsolwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a banhū benaba nakababilinga kū mongo ūyo gūkahūūmaga gūjile Ahava; a henaho twikala shikū idatū. Nahayūbalola chiza a banhū na a bagabīji, nūbona gīkī a Balawī baalī batīho hoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūtūma bitanwe ba Eliezeli, Alieli, Shemaya, Elinasani, Yalibu, Elinasani, Nasani, Zakalia, na Meshulamu abo baalī batongeeji; bitanwa na ba Yoalibu na Elinasani, abo baalī banhū bitegeleja; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna nūbatūma baje Kasifia kūlī Ido, ūyo walī ntongeeji wa kwenūko. Nūbalangīīla ī ya kūjūhaya ū kūlī Ido na a baana ba ng'wawe, a batūmami ba mu hekalu, abo bikalaga Kasifia; batūtūmīle banhū ba kūjūtūmama ū mu numba ya ng'wa Mulungu wise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ū nkono gwawiza ū go ng'wa Mulungu wise gwalī hamò nise, būtwenhela Selebia, munhū wa būdūla būtaale; ū wei walī wa kūfuma mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Mahili ng'wana Lawī, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Isilaeli. Biza na bitūnja bakwe ū Selebia hamò na badūgū bakwe; a bose baalī banhū ikūmi na banaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Hashabia wiza hamò na Yeshaya, wa kūfuma mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Melali, hamò na baana ba ng'wawe na bitūnja babo; a bose banhū makūmi abīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benha na batūmami magana abīlī na makūmi abīlī ba mu hekalu; banhū ba nīmo ūyo gwandiwa na Daūdi hamò na bagunanhi bakwe kūlwa kūbagunanha a Balawī. A banhū benaba pye baalī bandīkilwe a mina gabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwigolanya kūlwa kūshoka Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna aho tūtaalī a ha mongo gwa Ahava, nūlagīla gīkī tūfunge kūlwa kwidohya kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu wise, na kūnomba atwīlūkīle lūgendo lwawiza, a bise benekīlī na a baana bise, nī shose īsho twalī nasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nakacha minala ū kūnomba ū ntemi kūtwinha bashilikale na badamhīji ba falasa, ba kūtūlang'hana tūtizūnyang'wa ū mu nzīla; nguno twalī twamala kūng'wīla ū ntemi, “Ū nkono gwawiza ū go ng'wa Mulungu wise gūlī hamò na būlī munhū ūyo akankoobaga wei, alīyo ū būpelanu bokwe būlī kū bose abo bakanekaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū tūfunga, tūnomba ū Mulungu wise ū mhayo gwenūyū, ūtwigwa ū kūlomba kwise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho nūsolanya bagabīji ikūmi na babīlī abo baalī batongeeji; hamò na Shelebia, na Hashabia na badūgū babo ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūbapimīla ī shakwinha sha feza nī zahabu, nī shiseme īsho shalī shafunyiwa na ntemi, hamò na bagunanhi bakwe na a batūmami bakwe a bangī, na a Baisilaeli abo baalī kwenūko, abo baalī bafunya sabo jabo kūlwa nguno ya numba ya ng'wa Mulungu wise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūbapimīla, nūbinha tani makūmi abīlī n'ibīlī ja feza, shiseme igana līmò sha feza, sha būdito wa kūshika tani idatū na nusu; zahabu ja būdito bo tani idatū na nusu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mabakuli makūmi abīlī ga zahabu, būdito wago gītī kilo inaane na nusu; na shiseme shibīlī sha shaba īguusilwe yūteemagīla no no no, yūbiza na mpango ntaale gītī zahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūbawīla, “A bing'we mulī beela kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, nī shiseme shilī sheela. Ī feza nī zahabu shilī shakwinha sha wiyaabī kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shilang'hanagi chiza ī shikolo shenīshi, kūshisha ikanza lya kūshipima mu chumba sha mu numba ya ng'wa SEEBA ī Yelusalemu, kū būtongi wa bagabīji a batongeeji, na a Balawī, na a batongeeji ba kaya ja Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bagabīji benabo na a Balawī būjanukūla ī feza nī zahabu nī shiseme ī sheela īsho shikaping'wa ū būdito washo binhwa kūshitwala Yelusalemu kū numba ya ng'wa Mulungu wise.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
